              "kind": "text",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Nitralloy 135m® is an alloy steel specifically designed for the nitriding metal hardening process that demonstrates increased surface hardness and show good corrosion resistance. When fabricating parts from Nitralloy 135m®, the finished product often shows less distortion in heat treatment than parts fabricated from alloys requiring quenching and tempering to achieve similar surface hardness. Nitralloy 135m® may be heat treated in dissociated ammonia gas."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "[Alloy Steel Round Bar Offered at Titanium Industries can be found here.](https://qqa.titanium.com/product/mill-product-alloy-steel-round-bar)"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Standard Nitralloy 135m® Specifications"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "AMS 2301, AMS 6470, AMS 6472"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "ASTM A 370, ASTM A 29, ASTM A 355"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "EN 10204"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
